Hi Priya,

Those dates are open. The Lakehouse is a three-bedroom house on Lake Coeur
d'Alene with a private dock; it sleeps eight, so six is comfortable. There is
a hot tub on the deck, two kayaks you are welcome to use, wifi, and parking
for three vehicles. Summer rate is $410 a night.

I am sorry to say we cannot take pets: the owner is allergic.

Best,
Tom

